  "28 partner institutions in Brisbane, including Acknowledge Education, AIBI Higher Education and Alphacrucis University College.": "Sukulisiek 28 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Brisbane, kobooto Acknowledge Education, AIBI Higher Education ak Alphacrucis University College.",
  "26 partner institutions in Perth, including Acknowledge Education, AIBI Higher Education and Alphacrucis University College.": "Sukulisiek 26 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Perth, kobooto Acknowledge Education, AIBI Higher Education ak Alphacrucis University College.",
  "22 partner institutions in Adelaide, including Abbey College Australia, Acknowledge Education and Alphacrucis University College.": "Sukulisiek 22 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Adelaide, kobooto Abbey College Australia, Acknowledge Education ak Alphacrucis University College.",
  "Our counsellors can advise on study options in Gold Coast.": "Imuchi kirwogik chenyo koboorun oratinwek ab somanet eng' Gold Coast.",
  "5 partner institutions in Canberra, including Australian Catholic University, Australian National University and Canberra Institute of Technology.": "Sukulisiek 5 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Canberra, kobooto Australian Catholic University, Australian National University ak Canberra Institute of Technology.",
  "2 partner institutions in Darwin: Canterbury Institute of Management and Charles Darwin University (CDU).": "Sukulisiek 2 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Darwin: Canterbury Institute of Management ak Charles Darwin University (CDU).",
  "5 partner institutions in Hobart, including Australia Institute of Business and Technology (AIBT), Australian Vocational Training Academy (AVTA) and Reach Community College.": "Sukulisiek 5 che kiboisie ak acheek eng' Hobart, kobooto Australia Institute of Business and Technology (AIBT), Australian Vocational Training Academy (AVTA) ak Reach Community College.",
