  "Home to the iconic Sydney Opera House, a UNESCO World Heritage Site with over one million roof tiles.": "Ole mi Sydney Opera House ne kigen eng' ng'wony, ole ne kiripei UNESCO (World Heritage Site) ne tinye tiles kosiir milioni agenge eng' barak.",
  "Long ranked among the world's most liveable cities, known for its laneway cafés and arts scene.": "Kakigeer kasarta ne koi kou agenge eng' taunisiek che kararan missing eng' sobet eng' ng'wony, ne kigen amu cafés eng' oratinwek che ming'in ak tuguk ab sanaa.",
  "Australia's third most populous city, set on the winding Brisbane River.": "Taunit ne bo somok eng' Australia ne tinye biik chechang' missing, ne mi kobo Oinet ab Brisbane.",
  "One of the most geographically isolated major cities in the world, with vast desert to its east.": "Agenge eng' taunisiek che echen eng' ng'wony che mi ole ne ma mi taunisiek alak negit, ne tinye surkwen ne oo eng' kong'asis.",
  "Known as the \"City of Churches,\" with more places of worship per capita than any other Australian city.": "Kigure \"Taunit ab Kanisosyek\", amu tinye kanisosyek chechang' kosiir taunit age tugul eng' Australia, ye kegeer biik che mi.",
  "Famous for its golden beaches and Australia's largest cluster of theme parks.": "Kigen amu beaches che u dhahabu ak theme parks che chang' missing eng' Australia.",
  "Chosen in 1908 as a purpose-built capital, a compromise between rival cities Sydney and Melbourne.": "Kilewen eng' 1908 kou taunit ne oo ne kichob amu kiy noton, si kotar ng'olyon ne ki mi kwenutab Sydney ak Melbourne.",
  "Australia's tropical capital of the north, closer to Jakarta than to Canberra.": "Taunit ne oo ab kaskazini ab Australia ne bo kiptoret, ne mi negit Jakarta kosiir Canberra.",
  "Australia's second-oldest capital city, founded in 1804 on the Derwent River.": "Taunit ne oo ne bo aeng' eng' keny eng' Australia, ne kitaun eng' 1804 kobo Oinet ab Derwent.",
  "A tropical city in North Queensland, home to James Cook University and the gateway to the Great Barrier Reef and Magnetic Island.": "Taunit ne bo kiptoret eng' North Queensland, ole mi James Cook University ak kurgeet ab Great Barrier Reef ak Magnetic Island.",
  "World-class universities and a relaxed, multicultural lifestyle. We guide you from application to arrival.": "Univasitisiek che bo tai eng' ng'wony ak sobet ne tinye kaalyeet ne tinye biik ab ortinwek chechang'. Kiindochin kong'eten aplikesheni agoi ye kakiit.",
  "Check your eligibility for Australia": "Keer ngo imuchi isomane eng' Australia",
  "Coming soon": "Nyoonei kasarta ne ma koi",
  "World-ranked universities": "Univasitisiek che kigen eng' ng'wony",
  "A wide range of internationally recognised degree programmes across every discipline.": "Degrisiek chechang' che kiyan eng' ng'wony tugul eng' oratinwek tugul ab somanet.",
  "Practical, hands-on courses": "Kosisiek ab boisiet ab eunek",
  "Many courses combine classroom learning with practical, hands-on training.": "Kosisiek chechang' kotuiyei somanet ab kilasit ak boisiet ab eunek.",
  "Welcoming, diverse communities with a high standard of living.": "Biik che tinye chamyet ak che bunu ortinwek chechang', ne tinye sobet ne kararan missing.",
  "Hospitality & Tourism": "Hospitality & Tourism (Ukarimu ak Utalii)",
  "You apply for a Student visa (subclass 500) once your education provider issues your Confirmation of Enrolment (CoE). You must also meet the Genuine Student requirement, hold Overseas Student Health Cover (OSHC) for your whole stay, show you can pay for your tuition and living costs, and give an accepted English test result such as IELTS or PTE.": "Isomei Student visa (subclass 500) ye kakogochin sukul neng'ung' Confirmation of Enrolment (CoE). Imache kora iyai Genuine Student requirement, itinye Overseas Student Health Cover (OSHC) eng' kasarta tugul ne imi emonoton, iboru ile imuchi ilipan robinik ab sukul ak robinik ab sobet, ak igochi result ab tiemutik ab Kiingereza ne kiyan, kou IELTS anan PTE.",
  "Current visa subclass, fees and financial thresholds are set by the Australian government and change from time to time.": "Visa subclass ne mi raini, robinik ab visa ak robinik che imache iboru kochobei serikali ab Australia, ak kowalaksei kasarta ak kasarta.",
