  "Sample quotes are showing because no testimonials are switched on yet. Visitors on the live site never see samples. Add real ones on the admin page (admin/index.html).": "Ng'alek che kiboru amu taa ma kiyat ng'alek ab biik. Ma keer biik che chutei website ng'alek chu. Ib ng'alek ab imanit eng' ukurasa ab admin (admin/index.html).",
