  "A. Student’s rating": "Rating ab A. Student",
  "Every step was explained clearly, so I always knew what to do next.": "Ki kimwochan hatua age tugul komie, si ki anai kasarta age tugul kiy ne ayai kosubi.",
  "From choosing a course to booking my visa appointment, I was kept up to date and every question I had was answered.": "Kong'eten ye ki alewen kozi agoi ye ki asom betut ab visa, ki kimwochan ng'alek ne lel kasarta age tugul, ak ki kiwolchin teebutik tugul che ki atinye.",
  "Meet B. Parent": "Torookte B. Parent",
  "Parent, Australia": "Sigik, Australia",
  "B. Parent’s rating": "Rating ab B. Parent",
  "The team was quick to reply and patient with all of our questions.": "Ki kowolei timit chokyi ak ki kogas teebutik chenyo tugul komie.",
  "As parents we wanted to understand the costs and the timeline, and they took the time to walk us through both.": "Kou sigik, ki kimache kinai robinik che mache ak kasarta ne mache, ak ki kogoochin kasarta komwochech tugul aeng'.",
