  "The basics for each country. Rules and requirements change, so we confirm the details for your course at your free consultation.": "Tuguk che bo taunet eng' emet age tugul. Ng'atutik ak tuguk che mache kowalaksei, kou noton kigimitei ng'alek ab kozi neng'ung' eng' kirwoget neng'ung' ne ma kelipani.",
